  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #532.\n\n2.5D verify (D7): the kerf region swept on the program plane against the part section for gouge, start-hole and threading clearance through the full height, and slug analysis by geo2d region connectivity (which region is freed when the cut closes). Any flag blocks the post.\n\n**Done means:** a cut that enters the part, a blocked threading path, and an uncaptured slug each block the post by name. A clean die cut passes. Pinned by sim/app tests.",
